  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "影視劇本賞析",
    "sub_ename": "SCREENPLAY APPRECIATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程藉由深度賞析與討論各類型電影文本、各面向解析劇本、認識編劇與導演創作脈絡，建立感性賞析與理性論述的能力。透過期中及期末評論實作，建立個人獨特觀看視角與論述能力。",
    "describe_eh": "In this course, through in-depth appreciation and discussion of various types of film texts, analysis of scripts from various aspects, understanding of the creation context of screenwriters and directors, and establishing the ability of perceptual appreciation and rational discourse. Through the implementation of mid-term and final review, a unique perspective and discussion ability can be established.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
